{"v":"v63","content":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5;\"><!--StartFragment--><div style=\"--tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 1.5em !important;\">\n<!--StartFragment--><div style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; display: block; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><b><font style=\"font-size: 42px;\">Boere Hart</font></b></div><div style=\"line-height: 1; display: block;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.5; display: block;\"><div style=\"line-height: 0.25; display: block;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1; display: block;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><!--StartFragment-->\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\"><br></span><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\"></span></p><div style=\"line-height: 1.5; display: block;\"><div style=\"line-height: 0.75; display: block;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1; display: block;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Boere hart, Afrikaanse trots</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Grondpad wyd, hemel se blou</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Vas staan vors trots, kakiveld, klitterveer&nbsp;</span><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\"><br></span><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Tussen my bloed, dis wie ek is</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Boere hart, klop diep en sterk, in hierdie grond</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Lê my seer en weg</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Met growe hande bou ek weer en staan vas, deur elke keer&nbsp;</span><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\"><br></span><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Afrikaner trots, in my siel gebrand</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Onder oop hemel, oor droë land</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Van vuur tot reën wat my kom was</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Is dit hier waar my wortels vas</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Plaas dam koel, wilgerd takke lat, gesiggie mooi, grasade wind</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Boere hard Afrikaner trots growe hande breek die grond</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">En in elke dag hou ek net aan Boere hart</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Klop diep en sterk</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">In hierdie grond, lê my seer en werk</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Met growe hande bou ek weer en staan vas, deur elke keer&nbsp;</span><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\"><br></span><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Afrikaner trots, in my siel gebrand, onder oop hemel</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Oor&nbsp;\n<!--StartFragment-->droë<!--EndFragment-->&nbsp;land, van vuur tot reën wat my kom was</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Is dit hier waar my wortels vas</span></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\">Kittervuur, vlamme</span></p></div></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"></p></div></div></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"></p></div></div></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset; float: none;\"><span style=\"display: block; flex-direction: unset; grid-template-columns: unset;\"></span></p></div></div></div></div>","label":"Infinite Writer","style":{"lineHeight":"1.0"}}